MISSION

Implement the first shared Terminal Interaction foundation for the two existing
terminal consumers:

- NODE-OS Terminal
- RACK-OS Terminal

Both must share the same durable interaction behavior for:

- input
- focus
- command history
- live-draft preservation
- async submit guarding
- IME/composition
- terminal-output scrolling
- follow-tail
- common mobile input behavior

Do NOT unify their:

- commands
- command registries
- prompts
- gameplay operations
- output semantics
- operating-system identity

The durable behavior contract already exists in:

docs/design/TERMINAL_INTERACTION_V1.md

Do not duplicate that document in code or create a second competing Terminal
contract.


